      "content": "The purpose you're searching for is a fragile thing, and it's impossible to find it when you're staring into the abyss every shift. Don't confuse the endless cycle of suffering with a personal failure to find meaning. Just acknowledging that it's all pointless is a form of truth, and it's okay to let that truth settle in. Maybe the only purpose right now is to simply let yourself rest from the burden of trying to make sense of it all.",
